[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Percy Buttons]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.05]Who is Percy Buttons? | 谁是珀西·巴顿斯？
[00:14.50]I have just moved to a house in Bridge Street. | 我刚刚搬进了大桥街的一所房子。
[00:18.76]Yesterday a beggar knocked at my door. | 昨天一个乞丐敲我家门。
[00:22.36]He asked me for a meal and a glass of beer. | 他向我要一顿饭和一杯啤酒。
[00:26.54]In return for this, | 作为回报，
[00:28.41]the beggar stood on his head and sang songs. | 这乞丐倒立着唱了几首歌。
[00:32.87]I gave him a meal. | 我给了他一顿饭。
[00:35.17]He ate the food and drank the beer. | 他把食物吃了，啤酒也喝了。
[00:38.41]Then he put a piece of cheese in his pocket and went away. | 然后他把一块乳酪装进衣袋里走了。
[00:43.23]Later a neighbour told me about him. | 后来一位邻居告诉了我他的情况。
[00:46.47]Everybody knows him. | 大家都认识他。
[00:48.63]His name is Percy Buttons. | 他叫珀西·巴顿斯。
[00:51.37]He calls at every house in the street once a month | 他每月一次走街串巷，挨家挨户，
[00:55.39]and always asks for a meal and a glass of beer. | 总是要一顿饭和一杯啤酒。
